":0,"continue_watching_progress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Drama","Thriller","Crime"],"id":4380,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Mean Streets","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk46/shows/9215697b-7ecb-4649-8c04-12c3f4e434fb.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk56/shows/10f02d66-e658-4486-ab88-a1237e0c3b5e.jpg","likes":61,"dislikes":3,"views":4100,"release_date":"119404800000","length":6691,"description":"The future is set for Tony and Michael - owning a neighbourhood bar and making deals in the mean streets of New York city's Little Italy. For Charlie, the future is less clearly defined. A small-time hood, he works for his uncle, making collections and reclaiming bad debts. He's probably too nice to succeed. In love with a woman his uncle disapproves of (because of her epilepsy) and a friend of her cousin, Johnny Boy, a near psychotic whose trouble-making threatens them all - he can't reconcile opposing values. A failed attempt to escape (to Brooklyn) moves them all a step closer to a bitter, almost preordained future.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":7.3}],"value":7.3,"age":"R"},"episode_id":4380,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}